	•	Section 4 Comments/Quotes: Features with more than 40% missingness were excluded. Remaining continuous values were imputed using the mean, categorical values using the mode, and continuous predictors were standardized with z-score normalization. All preprocessing was fitted only within the training portion of the nested cross-validation. SMOTE was applied exclusively to training data within each fold. Exact outer-fold training and hold-out counts were not explicitly reported, and source code or trained model weights were not reported.

